<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT-Cristalerias reaffirmed buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cristalerias reaffirmed buy.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment reduced its 1997 and 1998 earnings per American Depositary Receipt estimates for glassmaker Cristalerias de Chile SA but reaffirmed its buy recommendation.</p>
<p>Santander lowered its 1996, 1997 and 1998 earnings per ADR forecasts to $1.28, $1.59 and $1.86 from $1.43, $1.79 and $2.16, respectively.</p>
<p>It said it was reiterating the buy recommendation on the basis of unchanged positive expectations for glass production, cable television operations, and the wine producing and exporting business.</p>
<p>((--Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
</text>
